{"seq":41,"data":{"type":"RUN_FINISHED","threadId":"bc104e8a-b767-4946-a401-a3159226f4f8","runId":"run_1_1788435034774","result":"Done! I've created the regex pattern in `/app/regex.txt`.\n\n**How it works:**\n\n1. **Lookahead IPv4 check** (`(?=.*\\b<IPv4>\\b)`): Verifies the line contains a valid IPv4 address\n2. **Greedy matching** (`.*`): Matches up to the last possible date (through regex backtracking within the line)\n3. **Date capture** with word boundaries: Validates YYYY-MM-DD with proper month/day rules\n   - 31-day months (01,03,05,07,08,10,12): days `0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01]`\n   - 30-day months (04,06,09,11): days `0[1-9]|[12]\\d|30`\n   - February: days `0[1-9]|[12]\\d|29`\n4. **Negative lookahead** (`(?!.*\\b<DATE>\\b)`): Ensures no more dates follow on this line\n\nThe regex ensures:\n- False matches like `1134-12-1234` or `192.168.1.11test` are rejected due to word boundaries\n- IPv4 octets without leading zeros (e.g., `192.168.1.1` but not `192.168.001.1`)\n- Only the last date per line is matched when multiple dates exist","rawEvent":{"duration_api_ms":129154,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"bc104e8a-b767-4946-a401-a3159226f4f8","total_cost_usd":0.09599085,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15039,"cache_read_input_tokens":26321,"output_tokens":14660,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":13601},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":15039},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":639,"cache_read_input_tokens":13632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14096,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":14096,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1158,"outputTokens":17,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001243,"contextWindo